# Keep Docker build contexts lean. The base image (Dockerfile) and the example
# images (examples/*/Dockerfile) all use the repo root as build context, so we
# exclude hoisted deps, VCS, local state, and stale build output. Every image
# reinstalls deps and rebuilds from source, so none of these are needed.
**/node_modules
node_modules
.git
.gitignore
data
*.log
examples/**/dist
examples/traefik/certs
packages/*/dist
